[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_AGRICULTURE_2]
Taking a Bite

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_AGRICULTURE_2_desc]
Even Appleloosa’s warning couldn’t change the decision of the second agricultural reform in Ponyville.\nEven if it means we will lose Appleloosa’s support and trade agreement, we must take a bite out of the apple.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_AGRICULTURE_2]
咬定立场

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_AGRICULTURE_2_desc]
即使是苹果鲁萨的警告，也不能改变小马谷进行第二次农业改革的决定。\n即使这意味着我们将会失去苹果鲁萨的支持、失去贸易协定，我们也要吃定这个苹果。

